msgid "<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px;\"> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"> <p>Dear Customer,</p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"> <p>We are excited to let you know that the product you added to your watchlist is now back in stock:</p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><h2>{product_name}</h2></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"> <img data-gjs-type=\"mail-custom-image-with-variable\" draggable=\"true\" alt=\"{product_name}\" src=\"\" path=\"{product_image}\" style=\"display:block;margin:auto\" class=\"mail-custom-image-with-variable gjs-plh-image gjs-selected\"> </div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\"> Currently available: {product_quantity} </p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p>Don’t wait too long—supplies might be limited! Click the button below to secure your item:</p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"> <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;\"> <a data-cke-saved-href=\"{product_url}\" href=\"{product_url}\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 16px; color: #fff; background-color: #00c8b7; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\" tabindex=\"0\"> Buy Now </a> </div> </div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p>Thank you for using our services, and we wish you a pleasant shopping experience!</p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p>If you need immediate assistance or have additional questions, feel free to reply to this email or contact us.</p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p>Best regards</p></div> <hr> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p>If you have any questions or need assistance, don’t hesitate to contact us.</p></div> </div> </div>"
msgstr "<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 10px;\"> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"> <p>Vážený zákazník,</p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"> <p>S radosťou vám oznamujeme, že produkt, ktorý ste si pridali do sledovania, je opäť na sklade:</p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><h2>{product_name}</h2></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"> <img data-gjs-type=\"mail-custom-image-with-variable\" draggable=\"true\" alt=\"{product_name}\" src=\"\" path=\"{product_image}\" style=\"display:block;margin:auto\" class=\"mail-custom-image-with-variable gjs-plh-image gjs-selected\"> </div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;\"> Aktuálne dostupné: {product_quantity} </p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p>Neváhajte príliš dlho—zásoby môžu byť obmedzené! Kliknite na tlačidlo nižšie a zabezpečte si svoj produkt:</p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"> <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;\"> <a data-cke-saved-href=\"{product_url}\" href=\"{product_url}\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 15px 30px; font-size: 16px; color: #fff; background-color: #00c8b7; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\" tabindex=\"0\"> Kúpiť teraz </a> </div> </div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p>Ďakujeme, že využívate naše služby a prajeme vám príjemné nákupné zážitky!</p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p>Ak potrebujete okamžitú pomoc alebo máte ďalšie otázky, neváhajte odpovedať na tento email alebo nás kontaktovať.</p></div> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p>S pozdravom</p></div> <hr> <div class=\"gjs-text-ckeditor\"><p>Ak máte akékoľvek otázky alebo potrebujete pomoc, neváhajte nás kontaktovať.</p></div> </div> </div>"

msgid "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6;\"><h1>Your inquiry has been placed</h1><p>Dear {fullName},</p><p>thank you for your interest! We will be reaching out to you shortly with further information.</p><p><strong>Inquired product:</strong></p><p><a data-cke-saved-href=\"{productUrl}\" href=\"{productUrl}\" style=\"color: #1a73e8; text-decoration: none\" tabindex=\"0\">{productName}</a> (Catalog number: {productCatnum})</p><p><img src=\"{productImageUrl}\" alt=\"{productName}\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max-height: 100px; height: auto;\" /></p><p><strong>Your contact details:</strong></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding: 0\"><li><strong>Name:</strong> {fullName}</li><li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:{email}\" tabindex=\"0\">{email}</a></li><li><strong>Telephone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:{telephone}\" tabindex=\"0\">{telephone}</a></li><li><strong>Company name:</strong> {companyName}</li><li><strong>Company number:</strong> {companyNumber}</li><li><strong>Company tax number:</strong> {companyTaxNumber}</li></ul><p><strong>Note:</strong></p><blockquote style=\"border-left: 4px solid #ccc;margin: 0 0 1em;padding: 0.5em;font-style: italic;background-color: #f9f9f9;\">{note}</blockquote><p>If you need immediate assistance or have additional questions, feel free to reply to this email or contact us.</p><p>Best regards</p></div>"
msgstr "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6;\"><h1>Váš dopyt bol odoslaný</h1><p>Vážený/á {fullName},</p><p>ďakujeme za váš záujem! Čoskoro vás budeme kontaktovať s ďalšími informáciami.</p><p><strong>Dopytovaný produkt:</strong></p><p><a data-cke-saved-href=\"{productUrl}\" href=\"{productUrl}\" style=\"color: #1a73e8; text-decoration: none\" tabindex=\"0\">{productName}</a> (Katalógové číslo: {productCatnum})</p><p><img src=\"{productImageUrl}\" alt=\"{productName}\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max-height: 100px; height: auto;\" /></p><p><strong>Vaše kontaktné údaje:</strong></p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding: 0\"><li><strong>Meno:</strong> {fullName}</li><li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:{email}\" tabindex=\"0\">{email}</a></li><li><strong>Telefón:</strong> <a href=\"tel:{telephone}\" tabindex=\"0\">{telephone}</a></li><li><strong>Názov spoločnosti:</strong> {companyName}</li><li><strong>IČO:</strong> {companyNumber}</li><li><strong>DIČ:</strong> {companyTaxNumber}</li></ul><p><strong>Poznámka:</strong></p><blockquote style=\"border-left: 4px solid #ccc;margin: 0 0 1em;padding: 0.5em;font-style: italic;background-color: #f9f9f9;\">{note}</blockquote><p>Ak potrebujete okamžitú pomoc alebo máte ďalšie otázky, neváhajte odpovedať na tento email alebo nás kontaktovať.</p><p>S pozdravom</p></div>"

msgid "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6;\"><p>A new product inquiry has just been received from <strong>{fullName}</strong>.</p><p>Please find the details below:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding: 0;\"><li><strong>Customer name:</strong> {fullName}</li><li><strong>Customer email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:{email}\" tabindex=\"0\">{email}</a></li><li><strong>Customer telephone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:{telephone}\" tabindex=\"0\">{telephone}</a></li><li><strong>Company name:</strong> {companyName}</li><li><strong>Company number:</strong> {companyNumber}</li><li><strong>Company tax number:</strong> {companyTaxNumber}</li></ul><p><strong>Note from customer:</strong></p><blockquote style=\"border-left: 4px solid #ccc; margin: 0 0 1em; padding: 0.5em; font-style: italic; background-color: #f9f9f9;\">{note}</blockquote><p><strong>Inquired product:</strong></p><p><a href=\"{productUrl}\" style=\"color: #1a73e8; text-decoration: none;\" tabindex=\"0\">{productName}</a> (Catalog number: {productCatnum})</p><p><img src=\"{productImageUrl}\" alt=\"{productName}\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max-height: 100px; height: auto; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 4px;\"></p><p>Please review the inquiry and take the necessary steps to follow up.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"{adminInquiryDetailUrl}\" style=\"background-color: #1a73e8; color: #fff; padding: 10px 15px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\" tabindex=\"0\">Review Inquiry</a></p></div>"
msgstr "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6;\"><p>Práve bol prijatý nový dopyt po produkte od <strong>{fullName}</strong>.</p><p>Nájdete tu podrobnosti:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding: 0;\"><li><strong>Meno zákazníka:</strong> {fullName}</li><li><strong>Email zákazníka:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:{email}\" tabindex=\"0\">{email}</a></li><li><strong>Telefón zákazníka:</strong> <a href=\"tel:{telephone}\" tabindex=\"0\">{telephone}</a></li><li><strong>Názov spoločnosti:</strong> {companyName}</li><li><strong>IČO:</strong> {companyNumber}</li><li><strong>DIČ:</strong> {companyTaxNumber}</li></ul><p><strong>Poznámka od zákazníka:</strong></p><blockquote style=\"border-left: 4px solid #ccc; margin: 0 0 1em; padding: 0.5em; font-style: italic; background-color: #f9f9f9;\">{note}</blockquote><p><strong>Dopytovaný produkt:</strong></p><p><a href=\"{productUrl}\" style=\"color: #1a73e8; text-decoration: none;\" tabindex=\"0\">{productName}</a> (Katalógové číslo: {productCatnum})</p><p><img src=\"{productImageUrl}\" alt=\"{productName}\" style=\"max-width: 200px; max-height: 100px; height: auto; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 4px;\"></p><p>Prosím, skontrolujte dopyt a podniknite potrebné kroky na jeho vybavenie.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"{adminInquiryDetailUrl}\" style=\"background-color: #1a73e8; color: #fff; padding: 10px 15px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;\" tabindex=\"0\">Zobraziť dopyt</a></p></div>"

msgid "<h1>Withdrawal from contract</h1> <p>Dear customer,</p> <p>We confirm receipt of your withdrawal from the contract for order <strong>{number}</strong>.</p> <p>We will process your withdrawal request and contact you within the following days regarding the next steps, including the return of goods and refund.</p> <h2>Order Details</h2> <p>Order number: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\">{number}</a></p> {products} <p>You can view your order details at any time: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\">View order detail</a></p> <p>Best regards,<br /> Your e-shop team</p>"
msgstr "<h1>Odstúpenie od zmluvy</h1> <p>Vážený zákazník,</p> <p>potvrdzujeme prijatie vášho odstúpenia od zmluvy pre objednávku <strong>{number}</strong>.</p> <p>Vašu žiadosť o odstúpenie spracujeme a v nasledujúcich dňoch vás budeme kontaktovať ohľadom ďalších krokov, vrátane vrátenia tovaru a refundácie.</p> <h2>Detaily objednávky</h2> <p>Číslo objednávky: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\">{number}</a></p> {products} <p>Detaily vašej objednávky si môžete kedykoľvek pozrieť: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\">Zobraziť detail objednávky</a></p> <p>S pozdravom,<br /> Váš tím e-shopu</p>"

msgid "<h1>Your order has been cancelled</h1> Dear customer,<br/> <br/> your order has been cancelled.<br/> <br/> Order number: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">{number}</a><br/> Date and time of creation: {date}<br/> {note}<br/> {transport_info}<br/> {transport_instructions}<br/> {payment_info}<br/> {payment_instructions}<br/> {products} <h3 style=\"text-align: right; margin: 0;\">Total price including VAT: <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">{total_price_with_vat}</span></h3> {rounding_info}<br/> {addresses}"
msgstr "<h1>Vaša objednávka bola zrušená</h1> Vážený zákazník,<br/> <br/> vaša objednávka bola zrušená.<br/> <br/> Číslo objednávky: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">{number}</a><br/> Dátum a čas vytvorenia: {date}<br/> {note}<br/> {transport_info}<br/> {transport_instructions}<br/> {payment_info}<br/> {payment_instructions}<br/> {products} <h3 style=\"text-align: right; margin: 0;\">Celková cena vrátane DPH: <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">{total_price_with_vat}</span></h3> {rounding_info}<br/> {addresses}"

msgid "<h1>Your order has been completed</h1> Dear customer,<br/> <br/> your order has been successfully completed.<br/> <br/> Order number: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">{number}</a><br/> Date and time of creation: {date}<br/> {note}<br/> {transport_info}<br/> {transport_instructions}<br/> {payment_info}<br/> {payment_instructions}<br/> {products} <h3 style=\"text-align: right; margin: 0;\">Total price including VAT: <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">{total_price_with_vat}</span></h3> {rounding_info}<br/> {addresses}"
msgstr "<h1>Vaša objednávka bola dokončená</h1> Vážený zákazník,<br/> <br/> vaša objednávka bola úspešne dokončená.<br/> <br/> Číslo objednávky: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">{number}</a><br/> Dátum a čas vytvorenia: {date}<br/> {note}<br/> {transport_info}<br/> {transport_instructions}<br/> {payment_info}<br/> {payment_instructions}<br/> {products} <h3 style=\"text-align: right; margin: 0;\">Celková cena vrátane DPH: <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">{total_price_with_vat}</span></h3> {rounding_info}<br/> {addresses}"

msgid "<h1>Your order has been placed successfully</h1> Dear customer,<br/> <br/> you will be contacted when the order state changes.<br/> <br/> Order number: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">{number}</a><br/> Date and time of creation: {date}<br/> {note}<br/> {transport_info}<br/> {transport_instructions}<br/> {payment_info}<br/> {payment_instructions}<br/> {products} <h3 style=\"text-align: right; margin: 0;\">Total price including VAT: <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">{total_price_with_vat}</span></h3> {rounding_info}<br/> {addresses} <a style=\"margin:0.75rem auto;display:flex;height:fit-content;width:fit-content;cursor:pointer;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0.5rem;border-radius:0.5rem;border:2px solid #00C8B7;background-color:#00C8B7;padding:7px 12px;text-align:center;font-weight:500;line-height:18px;text-decoration:none;outline:none;transition:all 0.2s ease;color:#fff;\" data-gjs-type=\"button-link\" data-link-position=\"center\" title=\"Order detail\" href=\"{order_detail_url}\" >Order detail</a>"
msgstr "<h1>Vaša objednávka bola úspešne odoslaná</h1> Vážený zákazník,<br/> <br/> budete kontaktovaný pri zmene stavu objednávky.<br/> <br/> Číslo objednávky: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">{number}</a><br/> Dátum a čas vytvorenia: {date}<br/> {note}<br/> {transport_info}<br/> {transport_instructions}<br/> {payment_info}<br/> {payment_instructions}<br/> {products} <h3 style=\"text-align: right; margin: 0;\">Celková cena vrátane DPH: <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">{total_price_with_vat}</span></h3> {rounding_info}<br/> {addresses} <a style=\"margin:0.75rem auto;display:flex;height:fit-content;width:fit-content;cursor:pointer;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0.5rem;border-radius:0.5rem;border:2px solid #00C8B7;background-color:#00C8B7;padding:7px 12px;text-align:center;font-weight:500;line-height:18px;text-decoration:none;outline:none;transition:all 0.2s ease;color:#fff;\" data-gjs-type=\"button-link\" data-link-position=\"center\" title=\"Detail objednávky\" href=\"{order_detail_url}\" >Detail objednávky</a>"

msgid "<h1>Your order is being processed</h1> Dear customer,<br/> <br/> we have started processing your order.<br/> <br/> Order number: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">{number}</a><br/> Date and time of creation: {date}<br/> {note}<br/> {transport_info}<br/> {transport_instructions}<br/> {payment_info}<br/> {payment_instructions}<br/> {products} <h3 style=\"text-align: right; margin: 0;\">Total price including VAT: <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">{total_price_with_vat}</span></h3> {rounding_info}<br/> {addresses}"
msgstr "<h1>Vaša objednávka sa spracúva</h1> Vážený zákazník,<br/> <br/> začali sme spracúvať vašu objednávku.<br/> <br/> Číslo objednávky: <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">{number}</a><br/> Dátum a čas vytvorenia: {date}<br/> {note}<br/> {transport_info}<br/> {transport_instructions}<br/> {payment_info}<br/> {payment_instructions}<br/> {products} <h3 style=\"text-align: right; margin: 0;\">Celková cena vrátane DPH: <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">{total_price_with_vat}</span></h3> {rounding_info}<br/> {addresses}"

msgid "<p>A customer has asked a question about a product.</p> <p><strong>Name:</strong> {customerName}<br> <strong>Email:</strong> {email}<br> <strong>Product:</strong> <a href=\"{productUrl}\" tabindex=\"0\">{productName}</a></p> <p><strong>Question:</strong><br>{question}</p>"
msgstr "<p>Zákazník položil otázku k produktu.</p> <p><strong>Meno:</strong> {customerName}<br> <strong>E-mail:</strong> {email}<br> <strong>Produkt:</strong> <a href=\"{productUrl}\" tabindex=\"0\">{productName}</a></p> <p><strong>Otázka:</strong><br>{question}</p>"

msgid "<p>Dear {customerName},</p> <p>Thank you for your question about <a href=\"{productUrl}\" tabindex=\"0\">{productName}</a>. We have received it and will get back to you by email as soon as possible.</p> <p><strong>Your question:</strong><br>{question}</p>"
msgstr "<p>Dobrý deň {customerName},</p> <p>Ďakujeme za Vašu otázku k produktu <a href=\"{productUrl}\" tabindex=\"0\">{productName}</a>. Prijali sme ju a čo najskôr sa Vám ozveme e-mailom.</p> <p><strong>Vaša otázka:</strong><br>{question}</p>"

msgid "<p>Order number {number} has been sent, thank you for your purchase. We will contact you about next order status. <br /><br /> <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">Track</a> the status of your order. <br /> {transport_instructions} <br /> {payment_instructions} <br /></p>"
msgstr "<p>Objednávka číslo {number} bola odoslaná, ďakujeme za váš nákup. Budeme vás kontaktovať ohľadom ďalšieho stavu objednávky. <br /><br /> <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">Sledovať</a> stav vašej objednávky. <br /> {transport_instructions} <br /> {payment_instructions} <br /></p>"

msgid "<p>Payment for order number {number} has been successful. <br /> <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">Track</a> the status of your order. <br /> {transport_instructions}</p>"
msgstr "<p>Platba za objednávku číslo {number} bola úspešná. <br /> <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">Sledovať</a> stav vašej objednávky. <br /> {transport_instructions}</p>"

msgid "<p>Payment for order number {number} has failed. <br /> Please contact us to resolve the issue.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Platba za objednávku číslo {number} nebola úspešná. <br /> Prosím, kontaktujte nás pre vyriešenie problému.</p>"

msgid "<p>We acknowledge your withdrawal from the contract for order number <b>{order_number}</b>.</p> <p>We will contact you in the following days regarding the next steps, including the return of the goods.</p> <p><a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">Show order detail</a></p>"
msgstr "<p>Potvrdzujeme vaše odstúpenie od zmluvy u objednávky číslo <b>{order_number}</b>. </p> <p> V nasledujúcich dňoch vás budeme kontaktovať ohľadom ďalších krokov, vrátane vrátenia tovaru.</p> <p> <a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">Zobraziť detail objednávky</a> </p>"

msgid "<p>We have received a request to withdraw from the contract for your order no. {order_number} on {domain}.</p> <p>To confirm the withdrawal request, click the following link: <a href=\"{url}\" tabindex=\"0\">Confirm withdrawal request</a>. The link is valid for 24 hours.</p> <p>If you did not make this request, you can ignore this email.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Dostali sme žiadosť o odstúpenie od zmluvy k vašej objednávke č. {order_number} na {domain}.</p> <p>Pre potvrdenie žiadosti o odstúpenie kliknite na nasledujúci odkaz: <a href=\"{url}\" tabindex=\"0\">Potvrdiť žiadosť o odstúpenie</a>. Odkaz je platný 24 hodín.</p> <p>Ak ste túto žiadosť nepodali, môžete tento email ignorovať.</p>"

msgid "<p>You’ve successfully selected a payment method. We’re now waiting for confirmation from the payment provider.</p> <p>If you haven’t completed the payment yet, please check your email for payment instructions.</p> <p><a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">Show order detail</a></p>"
msgstr "<p>Úspešne ste si vybrali spôsob platby. Teraz čakáme na potvrdenie od poskytovateľa platby.</p> <p>Ak ste ešte nedokončili platbu, skontrolujte si email s pokynmi na platbu.</p> <p><a href=\"{order_detail_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">Zobraziť detail objednávky</a></p>"

msgid "Administrator reset password request"
msgstr "Požiadavka na obnovenie hesla správcu"

msgid "Authentication code"
msgstr "Overovací kód"

msgid "Catalog"
msgstr "Katalóg"

msgid "Confirm withdrawal from contract - order no. {order_number}"
msgstr "Potvrďte odstúpenie od zmluvy - objednávka č. {order_number}"

msgid "Dear administrator,<br/><br/> you can set a new password following this <a href=\"{new_password_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">link</a>.<br/><br/> Best regards"
msgstr "Vážený administrátor,<br/><br/> môžete si nastaviť nové heslo pomocou tohto <a href=\"{new_password_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">odkazu</a>.<br/><br/> S pozdravom"

msgid "Dear customer,<br/> <br/> based on your email {email}, we are sending you a link to your personal details. By clicking on the link below, you will be taken to a page listing all thepersonal details which we have in evidence in our online store {domain}.<br/> <br/> To overview your personal information please click <a href=\"{url}\" tabindex=\"0\">here</a>.<br/> The link is valid for next 24 hours.<br/> <br/> Best regards<br /> Team of {domain}"
msgstr "Vážený zákazník,<br/> <br/> na základe vášho e-mailu {email} vám posielame odkaz na vaše osobné údaje. Kliknutím na odkaz nižšie sa dostanete na stránku so zoznamom všetkých osobných údajov, ktoré máme evidované v našom internetovom obchode {domain}.<br/> <br/> Pre zobrazenie vašich osobných informácií kliknite <a href=\"{url}\" tabindex=\"0\">sem</a>.<br/> Odkaz je platný nasledujúcich 24 hodín.<br/> <br/> S pozdravom<br /> Tím {domain}"

msgid "Dear customer,<br/> <br/> your registration is completed.<br/> <br/> Name: {first_name} {last_name}<br /> Email: {email}<br/> <br/> E-shop: <a href=\"{url}\" tabindex=\"0\">link</a><br /> Login page: <a href=\"{login_page}\" tabindex=\"0\">Log in</a><br/> <br/> Best regards"
msgstr "Vážený zákazník,<br/> <br/> vaša registrácia je dokončená.<br/> <br/> Meno: {first_name} {last_name}<br /> E-mail: {email}<br/> <br/> E-shop: <a href=\"{url}\" tabindex=\"0\">odkaz</a><br /> Prihlasovacie okno: <a href=\"{login_page}\" tabindex=\"0\">Prihlásiť sa</a><br/> <br/> S pozdravom"

msgid "Dear customer,<br/> <br/> your two factor authentication code is: {authentication_code}<br/> <br/> Best regards"
msgstr "Vážený zákazník,<br/> <br/> váš kód na dvojfaktorové overenie je: {authentication_code}<br/> <br/> S pozdravom"

msgid "Dear customer,<br/> based on your email {email}, we are sending you a link where you can download your personal details registered on our online store in readable format. Clicking on the link will take you to a page where you’ll be able to download these information, which we have in evidence in our online store {domain}.<br/> <br/> To download your personal information please click <a href=\"{url}\" tabindex=\"0\">here</a>.<br/> The link is valid for next 24 hours.<br/> <br/> Best regards<br /> Team of {domain}"
msgstr "Vážený zákazník,<br/> na základe vášho e-mailu {email} vám posielame odkaz, kde si môžete stiahnuť vaše osobné údaje registrované v našom internetovom obchode v čitateľnom formáte. Kliknutím na odkaz sa dostanete na stránku, kde si budete môcť stiahnuť tieto informácie, ktoré máme evidované v našom internetovom obchode {domain}.<br/> <br/> Pre stiahnutie vašich osobných informácií kliknite <a href=\"{url}\" tabindex=\"0\">sem</a>.<br/> Odkaz je platný nasledujúcich 24 hodín.<br/> <br/> S pozdravom<br /> Tím {domain}"

msgid "Dear customer,<br/><br/> you can set a new password following this <a href=\"{new_password_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">link</a>.<br/><br/> Best regards"
msgstr "Vážený zákazník,<br/><br/> môžete si nastaviť nové heslo pomocou tohto <a href=\"{new_password_url}\" tabindex=\"0\">odkazu</a>.<br/><br/> S pozdravom"

